            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "spindle taper runout test is conducted. This requires the test bar to be inserted into the headstock spindle. Incidentally, a runout test must be performed each and every time the test bar is removed and re-inserted to prove the truth of the seating. To nullify the effect of eccentricity error, the mean position is located at the vertical diameter for this portion of the test.",
            "block_bbox": [
                95,
