        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Now returning to the alignment we will mount a DIAL INDICATOR on the carriage. The button of the instrument is piaced at the vertical diameter of the test bar. Next the carriage is moved and a reading is taken between the spindle nose and the free end of the test bar. The amount of misalignment of the spindle to the bed ways in the vertical plane is thereby noted. This information relates to the first portion of OBJECTIVE NO. 1.",
            "block_bbox": [
                95,
