        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A similar preliminary check for OBJECTIVE NO. 1 in the horizontal plane is also necessary. This requires finding the mean position of the test bar and turning it to the horizontal plane. Then the button of the instrument is set at the near side of the test bar i.e. the horizontal diameter, as shown in Fig. 26.60. Again the carriage is traversed and the reading is recorded.",
